Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Resultados", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"aa6129a1-4bf6-4b6d-bc73-094821588cc2"],

Cell["\<\
Clases por n con K = 10: 3, 9, 34, 78, 70, 83, 68, 82, 81, 82 para n = 1..10. \
Desde ah\[IAcute], los tama\[NTilde]os con divisores chicos dan entre 80 y 83 \
clases, muy por encima de los momentos espectrales (m\[AAcute]ximo 72 con K = \
10) y de los eigenvalores (m\[AAcute]ximo 74). El m\[AAcute]ximo es 83, con n \
= 6 y 18 (y con n = 10, 14, 22 y 26 si K \[GreaterEqual] 20 o 30). Nunca \
supera a la forma can\[OAcute]nica (82\[Dash]85 clases): dos grafos isomorfos \
dan el mismo vector, y en todos los tama\[NTilde]os la partici\[OAcute]n por \
forma can\[OAcute]nica es m\[AAcute]s fina.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e95ba7cd-d04c-4590-84ff-4da1e7e26973"],

Cell["\<\
Como en los momentos espectrales, con K = 10 los tama\[NTilde]os con ciclos \
largos pierden informaci\[OAcute]n (n = 11, 13, 17, 19, 23, 29 dan entre 52 y \
54 clases; n = 22 y 26 dan 65). Al subir K se recuperan: con K = 60, n = 29 \
da 81 y n = 23 da 79.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"76c5ac84-d3e9-4c22-b549-8cabc287c8dc"],

Cell["\<\
Las reglas 0 y 8 quedan separadas para todo n \[GreaterEqual] 3. Combinando \
los 29 tama\[NTilde]os se obtienen 86 clases con cualquier K (contra 77 de \
eigenvalores y momentos espectrales), y dos tama\[NTilde]os chicos ya bastan: \
por ejemplo n = 1 y 6, o n = 3 y 6. Solo quedan juntos dos pares: {1, 19}, \
cuyas alturas exactas difieren (con p = 2, h = 1 contra h = 2) pero caen en \
el mismo intervalo de p pasos, que es la limitaci\[OAcute]n de resoluci\
\[OAcute]n del m\[EAcute]todo; y {4, 12}, que tienen exactamente la misma \
distribuci\[OAcute]n de (p, h) y solo difieren en la forma de los \
\[AAcute]rboles.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5ae01951-779b-4dc4-9db2-2035c4d915a7"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Momentos espectrales con masa de atractor del cociente por rotaciones: 88 \
reglas, n = 1, \[Ellipsis], 29\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"08c57d8a-3002-46e1-9f88-234a758853bd"],

Cell["\<\
Mismos momentos con masa de atractor, pero sobre el grafo cociente por \
rotaciones: h y p se calculan sobre el cociente, cada clase de \
rotaci\[OAcute]n cuenta como un nodo y el vector se normaliza por el n\
\[UAcute]mero de clases (la misma convenci\[OAcute]n que los momentos \
espectrales del cociente). Los sucesores del cociente se calculan en GPU con \
AllocateQuotient y kSuccQuot, y attractorMassC recorre solo los unos 2^n/n \
nodos: las 88 reglas con n = 29 tardan 43 s.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"47b4c3c3-e6fb-4f77-bfe6-4a68e4013aa8"],

Cell["\<\
Validaci\[OAcute]n: para n = 1..8 los primeros 30 momentos coinciden con el c\
\[AAcute]lculo directo de h y p sobre el cociente construido en CPU. En todos \
los tama\[NTilde]os la partici\[OAcute]n por forma can\[OAcute]nica del \
cociente es m\[AAcute]s fina que la de este vector.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ad5a9c2b-a810-4301-93ea-d50e9609fc34"],

Cell["\<\
Nota: AllocateQuotient recorta succ a exactamente nr entradas. La primera \
versi\[OAcute]n usaba ZerosInt32[nr], que redondea la longitud hacia arriba; \
con n \[GreaterEqual] 25 (nr > 2^20) quedaban nodos de sobra apuntando al \
nodo 0. Eso no cambia los ciclos (los eigenvalores y momentos del cociente se \
verificaron id\[EAcute]nticos para n = 21..29), pero s\[IAcute] las alturas, \
as\[IAcute] que la masa de atractor se recalcul\[OAcute] para n = 21..29 con \
la versi\[OAcute]n corregida.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"18cbb761-f8e2-4f95-a1ac-7e56b36a9a4b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Funciones", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"02e492c4-7dfb-4b4a-9d9d-9ccd5f92657e"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Una", " ", "regla", " ", "en", " ", "el", " ", "cociente", " ", "por", " ", 
     RowBox[{"rotaciones", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "sucesores", " ", "del", " ", "cociente", " ", "en", " ", "GPU", " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", "kSuccQuot", ")"}], " ", "y", " ", "alturas", " ", "en", " ",
        "CPU", " ", "compilado"}]}]}], ";", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "cada", " ", "clase", " ", "cuenta", " ", "como", " ", "un", " ", 
     "nodo"}]}], " ", "*)"}]}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"AttractorMassRotGPU", "[", 
    RowBox[{"r_Integer", ",", "buf_Association"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", "c", "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"kSuccQuot", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<succ\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<reps\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<idx\>\"", "]"}], ",", "r", ",", 
        RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<n\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<total\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<N\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<GridDimensions\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Quotient", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<N\>\"", "]"}], "-", "1"}], ",", "256"}],
            "]"}], "+", "1"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<BlockDimensions\>\"", "->", "256"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"c", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Partition", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"attractorMassC", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"NumericArray", "[", 
            RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<succ\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "amKmax"}],
           "]"}], ",", "amKmax"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"<|", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\"\<Rule\>\"", "->", "r"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<n\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<n\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Nodes\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<N\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Counts\>\"", "->", "c"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Moments\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"AttractorMassMoments", "[", 
          RowBox[{"c", ",", 
           RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<N\>\"", "]"}], ",", "amKmax"}], "]"}]}]}],
        "|>"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"1cbb3f22-65c8-\
4b91-96e3-39ed2b229394"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Experimento", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"6a4ddc1a-7eb5-4915-8726-4ee502bb2529"],

Cell["\<\
Cada tama\[NTilde]o se guarda en attractor_mass_rot_gpu_data.wl. Requiere \
attractorMassC, AttractorMassMoments, amKmax/amKs de la secci\[OAcute]n \
anterior y AllocateQuotient/kSuccQuot de la secci\[OAcute]n de eigenvalores \
del cociente.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1a42a763-acbc-47a3-a9f2-d66c1b4c7834"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"dataFileAMRot", "=", 
   RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Quiet", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Check", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"Directory", "[", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], 
      ",", "\"\<attractor_mass_rot_gpu_data.wl\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"amRotResults", "=", 
   RowBox[{"If", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"FileExistsQ", "[", "dataFileAMRot", "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Get", "[", "dataFileAMRot", "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"<|", "|>"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"If", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"!", 
       RowBox[{"KeyExistsQ", "[", 
        RowBox[{"amRotResults", ",", "n"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"buf", "=", 
           RowBox[{"AllocateQuotient", "[", "n", "]"}]}], ",", "rows", ",", 
          "t"}], "}"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"t", "=", 
          RowBox[{"First", "[", 
           RowBox[{"AbsoluteTiming", "[", 
            RowBox[{"rows", "=", 
             RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"AttractorMassRotGPU", "[", 
                RowBox[{"r", ",", "buf"}], "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"r", ",", "ecaReps"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], 
           "]"}]}], ";", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"amRotResults", "[", "n", "]"}], "=", 
          RowBox[{"<|", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<n\>\"", "->", "n"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<Nodes\>\"", "->", 
             RowBox[{"buf", "[", "\"\<N\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<Seconds\>\"", "->", "t"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<Classes\>\"", "->", 
             RowBox[{"AssociationMap", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
                RowBox[{"K", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"CountDistinct", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"#", ",", "K"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", 
                   RowBox[{"rows", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"All", ",", "\"\<Moments\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
                  "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "amKs"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<Groups\>\"", "->", 
             RowBox[{"AssociationMap", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
                RowBox[{"K", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"Values", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"GroupBy", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"rows", ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Moments\>\"", "]"}], ",", "K"}], 
                    "]"}], "&"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"#", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"All", ",", "\"\<Rule\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "&"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "amKs"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<Rules\>\"", "->", "rows"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"Put", "[", 
          RowBox[{"amRotResults", ",", "dataFileAMRot"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
     "]"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"n", ",", "1", ",", "nMax"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Dataset", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"<|", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\"\<n\>\"", "->", 
       RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<n\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Nodes\>\"", "->", 
       RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Nodes\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"Sequence", "@@", 
       RowBox[{"KeyValueMap", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<K = \>\"", "<>", 
             RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "#1", "]"}]}], ")"}], "->", "#2"}], 
          "&"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Classes\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "|>"}], 
    "&"}], "/@", 
   RowBox[{"Values", "[", 
    RowBox[{"KeySort", "[", "amRotResults", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",E\
xpressionUUID->"92a089a4-bfbb-4342-af73-26e48a0df48b"],

